ottle of dressing in just don't dress  it before you're going to eat it i would  say dressing has about 20 minutes before  the greens are starting to they're going  to start to break down and become mushy  the next thing is a really easy trick  you're just going to take a damp paper  towel and put it right on top of your  salad you can put it on the greens the  vegetables cheese proteins it's just  going to keep it really nice and bright  fresh crunchy you can do this the night  before the morning of whenever you have  this leftover salad  damp paper towel right on top  and then  put a lid on it  keep it in the refrigerator until you're  ready to eat  all right what do you think whoa  amazing thanks for leveling up my  leftovers  [Music]  you

